# Generation input for the Kotlin TField smart-cast receiver-stability fixture
# (PIT-388). The caller supplies -D kotlin-output=<dir>; this file is otherwise
# the complete generation input.
#
# Run from the worktree root:
#   haxe tests/haxe/kotlin-smartcast-tfield/kotlin.hxml -D kotlin-output=<dir>
#
# `-cp packages/compiler` names this tree's emitter explicitly. `-lib boring`
# resolves through the workspace haxelib projection, which in this workspace
# points into another worktree (PIT-376), and the fixture would then judge a
# tree other than the one under test -- the failure mode looks exactly like
# "the defect is gone".
-lib reflaxe
-cp packages/compiler
-cp packages/compiler/reflaxe/kotlin/std-shadow
-cp packages/compiler/reflaxe/kotlin
-cp tests/haxe/kotlin-smartcast-tfield
-cp samples
--macro Intercept.run(['samples', 'tests/haxe/kotlin-smartcast-tfield'])
--macro kotlincompiler.Compiler.use()
casee.CaseEOps
